
# Theme: BACKBONE
# Version 1.0
# Last Update: 01/17/2026
# License: CC-BY-SA 3.0
# By: Monica G.
# Description: BACKBONE is a spinoff of the minimalist BONES theme by Chuck Nardo! Some additions / modifications include:
# On the WPS, instead of track number, the playlist number is displayed / alternates with the time.
# Battery level is displayed on the WPS and bitrate is also shown plus more file types.
# Next song will display as the current track is ending.
# If a song is currently playing it is displayed on the SBS as well as play status.
# The menu title is displayed when navigating menus but will alternate to the time.
# Quick menu utilizes a smaller font and displays time / play status.
# A few lines are drawn in to add structure, but all icons remain unchanged.

## SBS File ##

# Disable Status Bar
%wd

# Disable Title
%?Lt<|>

# Preload Fonts
%Fl(2,15-ProFont.fnt)
%Fl(3,22-ProFont.fnt)

# Preload Images
%xl(X,bg_skull.bmp,0,0)
%xl(T,stop_icon.bmp,0,0)
%xl(L,play_icon.bmp,0,0)
%xl(Z,pause_icon.bmp,0,0)

# Display Viewports
%?if(%cs, =, 21)<%VI(clearScreen)%Vd(usbScreen)|%Vd(mainMenu)<%VI(mainMenu)%Vd(mainMenu)>>

# Clear Screen
%Vi(clearScreen,0,0,1,1,-)

## Main Menu ##

# Main Menu UI Viewport
%Vi(mainMenu,45,45,390,267,3)

# Hold indicator / Menu Title / Time
%Vl(mainMenu,45,12,360,22,2)
%?mh<HOLD|%t(2)%Lt;%t(15)%?cf<%cH|%cl>:%cM%?cf<| %cP>>

# Now Playing
%Vl(mainMenu,45,327,390,22,2)
%?mp<|%s%?it<%it|%fn>%?ia< - %ia>|>

# Play/Pause Icons
%Vl(mainMenu,-61,15,16,16,-)
%?mp<%xd(T)|%xd(L)|%xd(Z)>

# Line
%Vl(mainMenu,45,37,390,1,-)
%dr(0,0,390,1)

## Quick Screen ##

# Clear Screen
%?if(%cs, =, 10)<%Vd(QuickScreen)%VI(QuickScreen)>

# Quick Screen Viewport
%Vi(QuickScreen,45,45,390,267,2)

# Quick Screen Time
%Vl(QuickScreen,45,12,360,22,2)
%?cf<%cH|%cl>:%cM%?cf<| %cP>

# Quick Screen Line
%Vl(QuickScreen,45,37,390,1,-)
%dr(0,0,390,1)

## USB Screen ##

# USB Screen Viewport
%Vl(usbScreen,0,0,480,360,-)

# USB Text
%Vl(usbScreen,45,12,390,33,3)
%acUSB%Vs(invert)

# Eject Warning
%Vl(usbScreen,45,315,390,22,2)
%ac%t(1)! EJECT BEFORE DISCONNECTING !;%t(.1)%ac

# Skull
%Vl(usbScreen,45,90,390,195,-)
%xd(X)